            "name": "Partially Update Environment Compose Definition",
            "description": {
              "content": "Partially updates top-level fields of the environment's compose definition, such as architecture, task-level CPU/Memory, or min/max scaling capacity. Only fields included in the request body are modified. The 'containers' array, if provided, REPLACES the existing containers array; if omitted, the existing containers are NOT modified by this PATCH operation. (For modifying individual containers, use PATCH /containers/{containerName}). This triggers a validation, registers a new task definition, and updates the service.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
